    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "god_comp_desc",
      "x": 120, "y": 260,
      "width": 340, "height": 100,
      "text": "File: app/chat/new/page.tsx\n\nManages 11 state variables, streaming, \nJSON parsing, Debounced Saves, \nand Translation in one file.\nBreaks SRP. High risk of crashes.",
